[
  {
    "text": "Good morning,",
    "start": 2.159,
    "duration": 7.841
  },
  {
    "text": "good evening, good afternoon,",
    "start": 5.44,
    "duration": 9.4
  },
  {
    "text": "whatever time of day it is for you.",
    "start": 10.0,
    "duration": 4.84
  },
  {
    "text": "Arrive in this moment,",
    "start": 14.96,
    "duration": 6.239
  },
  {
    "text": "arrive and allow yourself to be here in",
    "start": 18.08,
    "duration": 6.359
  },
  {
    "text": "this space.",
    "start": 21.199,
    "duration": 3.24
  },
  {
    "text": "Take a deep breath.",
    "start": 27.279,
    "duration": 5.361
  },
  {
    "text": "Know that you are breathing in this",
    "start": 30.4,
    "duration": 6.92
  },
  {
    "text": "space. Be here.",
    "start": 32.64,
    "duration": 4.68
  },
  {
    "text": "Let everything before this moment fall",
    "start": 39.28,
    "duration": 5.32
  },
  {
    "text": "away.",
    "start": 41.6,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "Be aware only of what you sense in this",
    "start": 44.64,
    "duration": 5.72
  },
  {
    "text": "moment.",
    "start": 47.36,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "Your body, your breathing here.",
    "start": 51.76,
    "duration": 5.319
  },
  {
    "text": "[Music]",
    "start": 66.33,
    "duration": 3.109
  },
  {
    "text": "Welcome the sensing of your body in this",
    "start": 104.079,
    "duration": 4.481
  },
  {
    "text": "space.",
    "start": 106.64,
    "duration": 6.64
  },
  {
    "text": "Feel your toes, your feet, your legs,",
    "start": 108.56,
    "duration": 9.12
  },
  {
    "text": "your hips, your belly.",
    "start": 113.28,
    "duration": 4.4
  },
  {
    "text": "Take a deep breath and fill up the",
    "start": 118.079,
    "duration": 6.761
  },
  {
    "text": "chest. Allow it to empty.",
    "start": 120.24,
    "duration": 4.6
  },
  {
    "text": "Let your shoulders settle",
    "start": 128.0,
    "duration": 4.44
  },
  {
    "text": "easefully here.",
    "start": 133.04,
    "duration": 4.279
  },
  {
    "text": "Your arms",
    "start": 138.4,
    "duration": 6.8
  },
  {
    "text": "gracefully present. your hands",
    "start": 140.319,
    "duration": 8.28
  },
  {
    "text": "just here,",
    "start": 145.2,
    "duration": 3.399
  },
  {
    "text": "the stem of your neck,",
    "start": 152.0,
    "duration": 3.959
  },
  {
    "text": "the ease of your head.",
    "start": 156.48,
    "duration": 4.92
  },
  {
    "text": "Allow it to settle. Your chin slightly",
    "start": 161.44,
    "duration": 8.6
  },
  {
    "text": "down. Just a dip.",
    "start": 165.04,
    "duration": 5.0
  },
  {
    "text": "Your body settling into the space of",
    "start": 170.959,
    "duration": 4.161
  },
  {
    "text": "now.",
    "start": 173.44,
    "duration": 4.68
  },
  {
    "text": "Now",
    "start": 175.12,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "the air moving",
    "start": 181.36,
    "duration": 5.68
  },
  {
    "text": "in and out of your body.",
    "start": 183.76,
    "duration": 6.559
  },
  {
    "text": "The process of being alive.",
    "start": 187.04,
    "duration": 6.68
  },
  {
    "text": "Just here.",
    "start": 190.319,
    "duration": 3.401
  },
  {
    "text": "Just now. Just this.",
    "start": 193.76,
    "duration": 4.6
  },
  {
    "text": "Be aware that you're here.",
    "start": 296.639,
    "duration": 4.28
  },
  {
    "text": "I'm here.",
    "start": 302.0,
    "duration": 3.32
  },
  {
    "text": "Allow yourself to be grateful for this",
    "start": 399.759,
    "duration": 7.921
  },
  {
    "text": "body that allows you to be here,",
    "start": 402.4,
    "duration": 9.359
  },
  {
    "text": "that houses you here.",
    "start": 407.68,
    "duration": 7.359
  },
  {
    "text": "this body, this sensing being.",
    "start": 411.759,
    "duration": 4.801
  },
  {
    "text": "Huh?",
    "start": 415.039,
    "duration": 4.921
  },
  {
    "text": "I'm here.",
    "start": 416.56,
    "duration": 3.4
  },
  {
    "text": "May I be well?",
    "start": 421.28,
    "duration": 3.639
  },
  {
    "text": "May any knots in my body untangle",
    "start": 533.68,
    "duration": 4.92
  },
  {
    "text": "and just go free.",
    "start": 543.2,
    "duration": 3.8
  },
  {
    "text": "Just feel easy here just for these",
    "start": 550.56,
    "duration": 7.56
  },
  {
    "text": "moments while I'm here.",
    "start": 554.0,
    "duration": 4.12
  },
  {
    "text": "And I can just breathe.",
    "start": 560.16,
    "duration": 3.88
  },
  {
    "text": "Just breathe.",
    "start": 564.32,
    "duration": 3.32
  },
  {
    "text": "This is enough.",
    "start": 568.64,
    "duration": 6.36
  },
  {
    "text": "Just this.",
    "start": 571.68,
    "duration": 3.32
  },
  {
    "text": "Thank you myself for just being here for",
    "start": 594.16,
    "duration": 5.28
  },
  {
    "text": "this",
    "start": 597.12,
    "duration": 5.88
  },
  {
    "text": "for these moments.",
    "start": 599.44,
    "duration": 3.56
  },
  {
    "text": "May you be well.",
    "start": 613.68,
    "duration": 3.64
  },
  {
    "text": "May I be well.",
    "start": 618.48,
    "duration": 3.64
  },
  {
    "text": "Just now,",
    "start": 806.079,
    "duration": 6.2
  },
  {
    "text": "just here.",
    "start": 808.959,
    "duration": 3.32
  },
  {
    "text": "It's safe to be well.",
    "start": 813.2,
    "duration": 8.28
  },
  {
    "text": "I can be okay right here.",
    "start": 816.56,
    "duration": 4.92
  },
  {
    "text": "gathering your attention",
    "start": 826.16,
    "duration": 6.56
  },
  {
    "text": "if it feels okay somewhere",
    "start": 829.279,
    "duration": 5.441
  },
  {
    "text": "that you identify as your core. Maybe",
    "start": 832.72,
    "duration": 4.16
  },
  {
    "text": "your belly,",
    "start": 834.72,
    "duration": 6.08
  },
  {
    "text": "maybe in your heart space,",
    "start": 836.88,
    "duration": 7.56
  },
  {
    "text": "not in your head.",
    "start": 840.8,
    "duration": 3.64
  },
  {
    "text": "somewhere in the center of your body.",
    "start": 845.6,
    "duration": 4.44
  },
  {
    "text": "Relax into that space.",
    "start": 852.16,
    "duration": 4.039
  },
  {
    "text": "It's safe here right now.",
    "start": 856.959,
    "duration": 7.32
  },
  {
    "text": "Right now,",
    "start": 861.04,
    "duration": 3.239
  },
  {
    "text": "I can just breathe",
    "start": 864.88,
    "duration": 3.88
  },
  {
    "text": "and",
    "start": 869.6,
    "duration": 6.799
  },
  {
    "text": "I'm safe right here.",
    "start": 871.839,
    "duration": 4.56
  },
  {
    "text": "Nowhere else to be",
    "start": 879.36,
    "duration": 7.08
  },
  {
    "text": "just for these moments.",
    "start": 882.639,
    "duration": 3.801
  },
  {
    "text": "All I have to do is allow the body to do",
    "start": 887.12,
    "duration": 6.399
  },
  {
    "text": "what it does",
    "start": 891.199,
    "duration": 6.041
  },
  {
    "text": "to be alive.",
    "start": 893.519,
    "duration": 3.721
  },
  {
    "text": "I can just be here.",
    "start": 897.279,
    "duration": 5.081
  },
  {
    "text": "May I know this safety in my life,",
    "start": 910.639,
    "duration": 5.0
  },
  {
    "text": "even if only for a moment at a time.",
    "start": 915.76,
    "duration": 5.079
  },
  {
    "text": "May I be safe.",
    "start": 939.44,
    "duration": 3.72
  },
  {
    "text": "aware of myself in this space.",
    "start": 1369.76,
    "duration": 7.52
  },
  {
    "text": "Breathing,",
    "start": 1375.2,
    "duration": 3.92
  },
  {
    "text": "feeling,",
    "start": 1377.28,
    "duration": 4.84
  },
  {
    "text": "hearing,",
    "start": 1379.12,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "relying on my body.",
    "start": 1383.36,
    "duration": 4.199
  },
  {
    "text": "Even thinking",
    "start": 1388.72,
    "duration": 5.52
  },
  {
    "text": "thinking thinking",
    "start": 1391.039,
    "duration": 5.441
  },
  {
    "text": "here",
    "start": 1394.24,
    "duration": 7.0
  },
  {
    "text": "in this space in this moment.",
    "start": 1396.48,
    "duration": 4.76
  },
  {
    "text": "I can trust",
    "start": 1402.88,
    "duration": 3.64
  },
  {
    "text": "this is me",
    "start": 1407.039,
    "duration": 4.88
  },
  {
    "text": "here in this space.",
    "start": 1409.2,
    "duration": 4.88
  },
  {
    "text": "I am an aware",
    "start": 1411.919,
    "duration": 5.961
  },
  {
    "text": "of being here.",
    "start": 1414.08,
    "duration": 3.8
  },
  {
    "text": "I can trust.",
    "start": 1423.28,
    "duration": 3.56
  },
  {
    "text": "Here",
    "start": 1440.96,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "is my breath.",
    "start": 1454.24,
    "duration": 3.48
  },
  {
    "text": "Here is sound.",
    "start": 1458.32,
    "duration": 3.56
  },
  {
    "text": "Here's the weight of my hands.",
    "start": 1463.36,
    "duration": 4.439
  },
  {
    "text": "Here",
    "start": 1467.919,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "is the softness",
    "start": 1473.36,
    "duration": 7.0
  },
  {
    "text": "of the air on my skin.",
    "start": 1476.0,
    "duration": 4.36
  },
  {
    "text": "Awareness.",
    "start": 1484.799,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "I can hear.",
    "start": 1491.6,
    "duration": 3.559
  },
  {
    "text": "I can trust.",
    "start": 1495.279,
    "duration": 8.52
  },
  {
    "text": "This is how it is now in this moment.",
    "start": 1498.4,
    "duration": 5.399
  },
  {
    "text": "Not yesterday, not tomorrow.",
    "start": 1507.44,
    "duration": 8.359
  },
  {
    "text": "I can trust this moment.",
    "start": 1511.36,
    "duration": 4.439
  },
  {
    "text": "not thinking but that I think",
    "start": 1537.2,
    "duration": 8.8
  },
  {
    "text": "and I breathe and the body senses this I",
    "start": 1542.559,
    "duration": 6.6
  },
  {
    "text": "can trust.",
    "start": 1546.0,
    "duration": 3.159
  },
  {
    "text": "And I take a deep breath and let it out",
    "start": 1568.799,
    "duration": 5.0
  },
  {
    "text": "again.",
    "start": 1570.799,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "Trust",
    "start": 1575.679,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "[Music]",
    "start": 1792.59,
    "duration": 3.05
  },
  {
    "text": "Good morning everyone.",
    "start": 1811.919,
    "duration": 6.401
  },
  {
    "text": "My name is Maria",
    "start": 1814.799,
    "duration": 5.6
  },
  {
    "text": "and uh this morning we're going to",
    "start": 1818.32,
    "duration": 5.2
  },
  {
    "text": "continue our discussion of an ethical",
    "start": 1820.399,
    "duration": 6.88
  },
  {
    "text": "life, specifically the pre precepts.",
    "start": 1823.52,
    "duration": 7.279
  },
  {
    "text": "But I want to begin this morning. Um,",
    "start": 1827.279,
    "duration": 5.921
  },
  {
    "text": "today we're going to talk about uh the",
    "start": 1830.799,
    "duration": 5.921
  },
  {
    "text": "precept to refrain from harmful speech",
    "start": 1833.2,
    "duration": 5.92
  },
  {
    "text": "which is an gigantic topic. We can say",
    "start": 1836.72,
    "duration": 5.76
  },
  {
    "text": "very little about it in 15 minutes. So I",
    "start": 1839.12,
    "duration": 7.76
  },
  {
    "text": "want to read you a poem",
    "start": 1842.48,
    "duration": 6.72
  },
  {
    "text": "that talks about why we're doing this in",
    "start": 1846.88,
    "duration": 4.32
  },
  {
    "text": "the first place to sort of set the",
    "start": 1849.2,
    "duration": 5.839
  },
  {
    "text": "stage. This poem is by Wistawa Sorska",
    "start": 1851.2,
    "duration": 7.599
  },
  {
    "text": "who is a Polish uh Polish Nobel",
    "start": 1855.039,
    "duration": 7.12
  },
  {
    "text": "Prize-winning poet and it's called Life",
    "start": 1858.799,
    "duration": 6.081
  },
  {
    "text": "While You Wait.",
    "start": 1862.159,
    "duration": 5.281
  },
  {
    "text": "Life while you wait. Performance without",
    "start": 1864.88,
    "duration": 4.56
  },
  {
    "text": "a rehearsal.",
    "start": 1867.44,
    "duration": 4.8
  },
  {
    "text": "Body without alterations. Head without",
    "start": 1869.44,
    "duration": 4.8
  },
  {
    "text": "premeditation.",
    "start": 1872.24,
    "duration": 5.12
  },
  {
    "text": "I know nothing of the role I play. I",
    "start": 1874.24,
    "duration": 5.84
  },
  {
    "text": "only know it's mine. I can't exchange",
    "start": 1877.36,
    "duration": 5.28
  },
  {
    "text": "it. I have to guess on the spot just",
    "start": 1880.08,
    "duration": 5.199
  },
  {
    "text": "what this play is all about.",
    "start": 1882.64,
    "duration": 5.2
  },
  {
    "text": "Illprepared for the privilege of living,",
    "start": 1885.279,
    "duration": 4.4
  },
  {
    "text": "I can barely keep up with the pace that",
    "start": 1887.84,
    "duration": 4.64
  },
  {
    "text": "the action demands. I improvise,",
    "start": 1889.679,
    "duration": 5.6
  },
  {
    "text": "although I loathe improvisation.",
    "start": 1892.48,
    "duration": 5.199
  },
  {
    "text": "I trip at every step over my own",
    "start": 1895.279,
    "duration": 5.201
  },
  {
    "text": "ignorance. I can't conceal my hasty",
    "start": 1897.679,
    "duration": 5.441
  },
  {
    "text": "manners. My instincts are for",
    "start": 1900.48,
    "duration": 5.12
  },
  {
    "text": "hammistrionics.",
    "start": 1903.12,
    "duration": 4.72
  },
  {
    "text": "Stage fright makes excuses for me which",
    "start": 1905.6,
    "duration": 5.439
  },
  {
    "text": "humiliate me more. Extenuating",
    "start": 1907.84,
    "duration": 6.719
  },
  {
    "text": "circumstances strike me as cruel. Words",
    "start": 1911.039,
    "duration": 6.88
  },
  {
    "text": "and impulses you can't take back. Stars",
    "start": 1914.559,
    "duration": 5.761
  },
  {
    "text": "you'll never get counted. Your character",
    "start": 1917.919,
    "duration": 4.801
  },
  {
    "text": "like a raincoat you button on the run.",
    "start": 1920.32,
    "duration": 4.239
  },
  {
    "text": "The pitiful results of all this",
    "start": 1922.72,
    "duration": 4.0
  },
  {
    "text": "unexpectedness.",
    "start": 1924.559,
    "duration": 4.161
  },
  {
    "text": "If I could just rehearse one Wednesday",
    "start": 1926.72,
    "duration": 5.12
  },
  {
    "text": "in advance or repeat a single Thursday",
    "start": 1928.72,
    "duration": 5.839
  },
  {
    "text": "that has passed. But here comes Friday",
    "start": 1931.84,
    "duration": 4.64
  },
  {
    "text": "with a script I haven't seen. Is it",
    "start": 1934.559,
    "duration": 4.72
  },
  {
    "text": "fair? I ask my voice a little horsearse",
    "start": 1936.48,
    "duration": 4.4
  },
  {
    "text": "since I couldn't even clear my throat",
    "start": 1939.279,
    "duration": 4.321
  },
  {
    "text": "off stage. You'd be wrong to think it's",
    "start": 1940.88,
    "duration": 5.76
  },
  {
    "text": "just a slap dash quiz taken in makeshift",
    "start": 1943.6,
    "duration": 6.16
  },
  {
    "text": "accommodations. Oh no. I'm standing on",
    "start": 1946.64,
    "duration": 6.0
  },
  {
    "text": "the set and I see how strong it is. The",
    "start": 1949.76,
    "duration": 5.68
  },
  {
    "text": "props are surprisingly precise. The",
    "start": 1952.64,
    "duration": 4.72
  },
  {
    "text": "machine rotating the stage has been",
    "start": 1955.44,
    "duration": 4.239
  },
  {
    "text": "around even longer. The farthest",
    "start": 1957.36,
    "duration": 5.039
  },
  {
    "text": "galaxies have been turned on. Oh no,",
    "start": 1959.679,
    "duration": 5.521
  },
  {
    "text": "there's no question. This must be the",
    "start": 1962.399,
    "duration": 6.64
  },
  {
    "text": "premiere. And whatever I do will become",
    "start": 1965.2,
    "duration": 8.12
  },
  {
    "text": "forever what I've done.",
    "start": 1969.039,
    "duration": 4.281
  },
  {
    "text": "That's the crux of it. And whatever I do",
    "start": 1974.24,
    "duration": 6.319
  },
  {
    "text": "will become forever what I've done.",
    "start": 1976.96,
    "duration": 6.48
  },
  {
    "text": "You know, we don't actually get to do",
    "start": 1980.559,
    "duration": 5.84
  },
  {
    "text": "life over. This is it. This is the whole",
    "start": 1983.44,
    "duration": 6.32
  },
  {
    "text": "thing. What we do now, what we say now,",
    "start": 1986.399,
    "duration": 7.601
  },
  {
    "text": "what we gesture now, how we move now.",
    "start": 1989.76,
    "duration": 6.799
  },
  {
    "text": "This is it.",
    "start": 1994.0,
    "duration": 6.24
  },
  {
    "text": "The reason that we put emphasis on our",
    "start": 1996.559,
    "duration": 6.24
  },
  {
    "text": "ethical conduct, the way we live in the",
    "start": 2000.24,
    "duration": 4.799
  },
  {
    "text": "world,",
    "start": 2002.799,
    "duration": 4.161
  },
  {
    "text": "the way we make an effort to live with",
    "start": 2005.039,
    "duration": 4.88
  },
  {
    "text": "an open heart. The reason for that is",
    "start": 2006.96,
    "duration": 5.04
  },
  {
    "text": "this is the only chance we get to do",
    "start": 2009.919,
    "duration": 5.681
  },
  {
    "text": "that. We don't get to live it over. We",
    "start": 2012.0,
    "duration": 6.64
  },
  {
    "text": "actually don't get to live it over.",
    "start": 2015.6,
    "duration": 4.559
  },
  {
    "text": "Those",
    "start": 2018.64,
    "duration": 4.24
  },
  {
    "text": "are nice fantasies,",
    "start": 2020.159,
    "duration": 5.36
  },
  {
    "text": "but what we say now,",
    "start": 2022.88,
    "duration": 5.12
  },
  {
    "text": "that's it. We've said it.",
    "start": 2025.519,
    "duration": 4.081
  },
  {
    "text": "And we've all had the experience of",
    "start": 2028.0,
    "duration": 4.64
  },
  {
    "text": "saying, \"Oh, I wish I hadn't said that.\"",
    "start": 2029.6,
    "duration": 5.04
  },
  {
    "text": "Or we say something and it's totally",
    "start": 2032.64,
    "duration": 3.759
  },
  {
    "text": "misinterpreted.",
    "start": 2034.64,
    "duration": 3.2
  },
  {
    "text": "And we say, \"But that's not what I",
    "start": 2036.399,
    "duration": 2.961
  },
  {
    "text": "meant.\"",
    "start": 2037.84,
    "duration": 5.319
  },
  {
    "text": "And the harm is done.",
    "start": 2039.36,
    "duration": 3.799
  },
  {
    "text": "And our goal is not to harm people by",
    "start": 2043.36,
    "duration": 5.559
  },
  {
    "text": "our speech.",
    "start": 2045.679,
    "duration": 3.24
  },
  {
    "text": "Or is it",
    "start": 2051.839,
    "duration": 5.681
  },
  {
    "text": "and this is the crux of the matter to be",
    "start": 2054.56,
    "duration": 5.76
  },
  {
    "text": "clear in our hearts.",
    "start": 2057.52,
    "duration": 5.52
  },
  {
    "text": "I do not want to harm others by my",
    "start": 2060.32,
    "duration": 4.799
  },
  {
    "text": "speech. Usually we think in terms of",
    "start": 2063.04,
    "duration": 5.039
  },
  {
    "text": "telling lies or gossiping or revealing",
    "start": 2065.119,
    "duration": 5.121
  },
  {
    "text": "secrets. You know I don't want to reveal",
    "start": 2068.079,
    "duration": 3.921
  },
  {
    "text": "your secrets because that's not fair to",
    "start": 2070.24,
    "duration": 5.359
  },
  {
    "text": "you. It's yours to reveal.",
    "start": 2072.0,
    "duration": 5.28
  },
  {
    "text": "And we kind of hide behind the",
    "start": 2075.599,
    "duration": 3.841
  },
  {
    "text": "factualness of speech, right? If I just",
    "start": 2077.28,
    "duration": 5.839
  },
  {
    "text": "tell what's true, then I'm safe. But of",
    "start": 2079.44,
    "duration": 7.28
  },
  {
    "text": "course, we all know that's not true.",
    "start": 2083.119,
    "duration": 5.681
  },
  {
    "text": "I might say something that I think is",
    "start": 2086.72,
    "duration": 6.48
  },
  {
    "text": "true, and it might not be. Or I might",
    "start": 2088.8,
    "duration": 6.64
  },
  {
    "text": "say something that's true that is",
    "start": 2093.2,
    "duration": 3.84
  },
  {
    "text": "harmful",
    "start": 2095.44,
    "duration": 5.2
  },
  {
    "text": "to you, to my friends, to my family, to",
    "start": 2097.04,
    "duration": 6.72
  },
  {
    "text": "my enemies.",
    "start": 2100.64,
    "duration": 4.8
  },
  {
    "text": "So there's the pattern. There's the",
    "start": 2103.76,
    "duration": 4.96
  },
  {
    "text": "pattern that we that we know about uh",
    "start": 2105.44,
    "duration": 6.96
  },
  {
    "text": "speech that is not harmful. Is it true?",
    "start": 2108.72,
    "duration": 6.24
  },
  {
    "text": "Is it useful?",
    "start": 2112.4,
    "duration": 4.24
  },
  {
    "text": "No. Does saying this make any",
    "start": 2114.96,
    "duration": 4.96
  },
  {
    "text": "difference? Or is it just flapping of",
    "start": 2116.64,
    "duration": 7.24
  },
  {
    "text": "lips? Or",
    "start": 2119.92,
    "duration": 3.96
  },
  {
    "text": "I'm going to say this even though I know",
    "start": 2124.4,
    "duration": 3.76
  },
  {
    "text": "I can't influence you in any way, but",
    "start": 2126.16,
    "duration": 4.8
  },
  {
    "text": "I'm going to say it anyway. Or is it",
    "start": 2128.16,
    "duration": 7.04
  },
  {
    "text": "timely? This is the time to say it.",
    "start": 2130.96,
    "duration": 6.0
  },
  {
    "text": "In discussions with my husband, when",
    "start": 2135.2,
    "duration": 4.96
  },
  {
    "text": "we're both really agitated, I don't want",
    "start": 2136.96,
    "duration": 6.8
  },
  {
    "text": "to say anything really important",
    "start": 2140.16,
    "duration": 6.56
  },
  {
    "text": "and I'll leave the room, come back,",
    "start": 2143.76,
    "duration": 6.88
  },
  {
    "text": "leave the room, come back until",
    "start": 2146.72,
    "duration": 6.72
  },
  {
    "text": "my energy level is a point where what I",
    "start": 2150.64,
    "duration": 5.92
  },
  {
    "text": "say is not harmful.",
    "start": 2153.44,
    "duration": 5.28
  },
  {
    "text": "Now, is it timely? And the most",
    "start": 2156.56,
    "duration": 4.88
  },
  {
    "text": "important thing, is it kind?",
    "start": 2158.72,
    "duration": 5.2
  },
  {
    "text": "Okay, so is it true? Is it useful? Is it",
    "start": 2161.44,
    "duration": 5.52
  },
  {
    "text": "timely? Is it kind?",
    "start": 2163.92,
    "duration": 4.64
  },
  {
    "text": "But the first place we have to do is",
    "start": 2166.96,
    "duration": 3.28
  },
  {
    "text": "look at what is our motivation for",
    "start": 2168.56,
    "duration": 3.36
  },
  {
    "text": "speech.",
    "start": 2170.24,
    "duration": 4.0
  },
  {
    "text": "Why are we saying it in the first place?",
    "start": 2171.92,
    "duration": 4.56
  },
  {
    "text": "To enlighten,",
    "start": 2174.24,
    "duration": 5.599
  },
  {
    "text": "you know, to explain,",
    "start": 2176.48,
    "duration": 6.24
  },
  {
    "text": "to satisfy curiosity,",
    "start": 2179.839,
    "duration": 5.52
  },
  {
    "text": "to punish,",
    "start": 2182.72,
    "duration": 4.96
  },
  {
    "text": "to convince.",
    "start": 2185.359,
    "duration": 6.48
  },
  {
    "text": "Very often it has to do with self",
    "start": 2187.68,
    "duration": 7.84
  },
  {
    "text": "self-reflection. How am I seen? You",
    "start": 2191.839,
    "duration": 5.681
  },
  {
    "text": "know, sometimes",
    "start": 2195.52,
    "duration": 4.079
  },
  {
    "text": "I will catch myself in the middle of a",
    "start": 2197.52,
    "duration": 5.04
  },
  {
    "text": "discussion and realize I just want to be",
    "start": 2199.599,
    "duration": 6.081
  },
  {
    "text": "right. I'm right. I'm right. And I I",
    "start": 2202.56,
    "duration": 5.84
  },
  {
    "text": "need you to know I'm right. And then I",
    "start": 2205.68,
    "duration": 5.6
  },
  {
    "text": "ask myself, how important is it to be",
    "start": 2208.4,
    "duration": 6.24
  },
  {
    "text": "right in this situation?",
    "start": 2211.28,
    "duration": 5.52
  },
  {
    "text": "Does it matter?",
    "start": 2214.64,
    "duration": 4.719
  },
  {
    "text": "Does it even matter tomorrow whether I",
    "start": 2216.8,
    "duration": 7.0
  },
  {
    "text": "am right about this thing?",
    "start": 2219.359,
    "duration": 4.441
  },
  {
    "text": "And there's all this Sturman drank",
    "start": 2226.4,
    "duration": 4.6
  },
  {
    "text": "primarily speech is about views.",
    "start": 2231.28,
    "duration": 7.68
  },
  {
    "text": "Views in me. Views in me. I believe",
    "start": 2234.96,
    "duration": 6.879
  },
  {
    "text": "this, you believe that. And our views",
    "start": 2238.96,
    "duration": 5.92
  },
  {
    "text": "clash. And we both believe our views are",
    "start": 2241.839,
    "duration": 5.52
  },
  {
    "text": "true. And when we're fortunate, our",
    "start": 2244.88,
    "duration": 6.0
  },
  {
    "text": "views agree and align and we're and now",
    "start": 2247.359,
    "duration": 7.561
  },
  {
    "text": "this is what we call truth.",
    "start": 2250.88,
    "duration": 4.04
  },
  {
    "text": "Be aware of how your views are",
    "start": 2255.68,
    "duration": 4.88
  },
  {
    "text": "influencing your speech.",
    "start": 2257.76,
    "duration": 8.68
  },
  {
    "text": "Know when a view is just a view.",
    "start": 2260.56,
    "duration": 5.88
  },
  {
    "text": "Know when a view has to do with",
    "start": 2267.44,
    "duration": 3.84
  },
  {
    "text": "belonging.",
    "start": 2269.2,
    "duration": 4.159
  },
  {
    "text": "There's nothing wrong with the wish to",
    "start": 2271.28,
    "duration": 5.079
  },
  {
    "text": "belong.",
    "start": 2273.359,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "But know when it's influencing what",
    "start": 2278.72,
    "duration": 5.16
  },
  {
    "text": "you're saying,",
    "start": 2280.64,
    "duration": 3.24
  },
  {
    "text": "when it's we all think this,",
    "start": 2287.52,
    "duration": 6.48
  },
  {
    "text": "you know, my grandson last week said is",
    "start": 2291.119,
    "duration": 5.041
  },
  {
    "text": "on a soccer team and he says, you know,",
    "start": 2294.0,
    "duration": 4.0
  },
  {
    "text": "all these all the guys on my team are",
    "start": 2296.16,
    "duration": 4.16
  },
  {
    "text": "real jocks and they, you know, they just",
    "start": 2298.0,
    "duration": 5.04
  },
  {
    "text": "they all hang out together and and he",
    "start": 2300.32,
    "duration": 4.88
  },
  {
    "text": "loves my grandson loves loves soccer,",
    "start": 2303.04,
    "duration": 4.319
  },
  {
    "text": "really loves soccer. And he says, you",
    "start": 2305.2,
    "duration": 4.879
  },
  {
    "text": "know, so the other day, you know, I",
    "start": 2307.359,
    "duration": 4.081
  },
  {
    "text": "don't hang out with them at school",
    "start": 2310.079,
    "duration": 2.721
  },
  {
    "text": "because they, you know, they just want",
    "start": 2311.44,
    "duration": 2.88
  },
  {
    "text": "to do jock things and I have other",
    "start": 2312.8,
    "duration": 3.76
  },
  {
    "text": "things I'm interested in. So the guy",
    "start": 2314.32,
    "duration": 3.84
  },
  {
    "text": "came up to me and he said, you know,",
    "start": 2316.56,
    "duration": 3.92
  },
  {
    "text": "nobody likes you. He says, I just don't",
    "start": 2318.16,
    "duration": 4.64
  },
  {
    "text": "pay any attention to that. And I'm",
    "start": 2320.48,
    "duration": 4.8
  },
  {
    "text": "thinking, wow, that sounds really",
    "start": 2322.8,
    "duration": 5.12
  },
  {
    "text": "uncomfortable. Nobody likes you because",
    "start": 2325.28,
    "duration": 6.16
  },
  {
    "text": "you're not hanging out with us, right?",
    "start": 2327.92,
    "duration": 6.08
  },
  {
    "text": "Us. you need to be part of us because",
    "start": 2331.44,
    "duration": 6.2
  },
  {
    "text": "you're on our team.",
    "start": 2334.0,
    "duration": 3.64
  },
  {
    "text": "And so I worried about that because I",
    "start": 2338.32,
    "duration": 3.36
  },
  {
    "text": "thought, wow, this is going to be really",
    "start": 2340.16,
    "duration": 4.32
  },
  {
    "text": "hard on him. But as it turns out, he's a",
    "start": 2341.68,
    "duration": 5.439
  },
  {
    "text": "really good soccer player",
    "start": 2344.48,
    "duration": 4.32
  },
  {
    "text": "and I went to his game last week and",
    "start": 2347.119,
    "duration": 3.281
  },
  {
    "text": "everything's great because he's a good",
    "start": 2348.8,
    "duration": 3.76
  },
  {
    "text": "soccer player. And now they don't care",
    "start": 2350.4,
    "duration": 6.32
  },
  {
    "text": "whether he is with us at other times as",
    "start": 2352.56,
    "duration": 8.48
  },
  {
    "text": "long as he's with us on on the field.",
    "start": 2356.72,
    "duration": 8.08
  },
  {
    "text": "That sense of belonging",
    "start": 2361.04,
    "duration": 7.52
  },
  {
    "text": "can actually create a lot of stress in",
    "start": 2364.8,
    "duration": 6.76
  },
  {
    "text": "life.",
    "start": 2368.56,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "Speech is also about managing emotions",
    "start": 2373.119,
    "duration": 6.561
  },
  {
    "text": "or the mismanagement of of emotions.",
    "start": 2376.16,
    "duration": 7.24
  },
  {
    "text": "How do we do that?",
    "start": 2379.68,
    "duration": 3.72
  },
  {
    "text": "If we're, you know, we all know people",
    "start": 2385.44,
    "duration": 4.32
  },
  {
    "text": "that um",
    "start": 2387.28,
    "duration": 4.88
  },
  {
    "text": "that feel difficult to us for one reason",
    "start": 2389.76,
    "duration": 5.599
  },
  {
    "text": "or another,",
    "start": 2392.16,
    "duration": 6.16
  },
  {
    "text": "it might be because we like helping",
    "start": 2395.359,
    "duration": 6.881
  },
  {
    "text": "people. So, we're not comfortable around",
    "start": 2398.32,
    "duration": 6.08
  },
  {
    "text": "people that want us to tell them about",
    "start": 2402.24,
    "duration": 8.32
  },
  {
    "text": "us. We want them to lean on us.",
    "start": 2404.4,
    "duration": 8.08
  },
  {
    "text": "Or",
    "start": 2410.56,
    "duration": 4.88
  },
  {
    "text": "there are people who lean all the time",
    "start": 2412.48,
    "duration": 5.04
  },
  {
    "text": "and it's a burden and we don't want them",
    "start": 2415.44,
    "duration": 4.56
  },
  {
    "text": "to lean on us.",
    "start": 2417.52,
    "duration": 4.24
  },
  {
    "text": "And that's all taking place through",
    "start": 2420.0,
    "duration": 4.16
  },
  {
    "text": "communication and the speech and the way",
    "start": 2421.76,
    "duration": 7.16
  },
  {
    "text": "we talk and how we talk to them.",
    "start": 2424.16,
    "duration": 4.76
  },
  {
    "text": "Or we're running on carrying on a",
    "start": 2431.44,
    "duration": 5.28
  },
  {
    "text": "conversation and we know how the",
    "start": 2433.92,
    "duration": 4.96
  },
  {
    "text": "sentence ends and so we finish it for",
    "start": 2436.72,
    "duration": 4.96
  },
  {
    "text": "them. Although although we don't",
    "start": 2438.88,
    "duration": 5.199
  },
  {
    "text": "actually know what they want to say and",
    "start": 2441.68,
    "duration": 5.28
  },
  {
    "text": "they feel run over",
    "start": 2444.079,
    "duration": 4.481
  },
  {
    "text": "because you know they have been run",
    "start": 2446.96,
    "duration": 3.119
  },
  {
    "text": "over.",
    "start": 2448.56,
    "duration": 3.279
  },
  {
    "text": "There is that part. They have been run",
    "start": 2450.079,
    "duration": 5.04
  },
  {
    "text": "over. I'm a finishing someone's sentence",
    "start": 2451.839,
    "duration": 5.52
  },
  {
    "text": "kind of person. So it's something that I",
    "start": 2455.119,
    "duration": 6.361
  },
  {
    "text": "have to watch for all the time.",
    "start": 2457.359,
    "duration": 4.121
  },
  {
    "text": "Or you're halfway through your sentence",
    "start": 2462.48,
    "duration": 3.92
  },
  {
    "text": "and somebody says, \"Oh, I know what",
    "start": 2464.8,
    "duration": 3.36
  },
  {
    "text": "you're talking about. it's this and it's",
    "start": 2466.4,
    "duration": 5.679
  },
  {
    "text": "actually that and to watch for that and",
    "start": 2468.16,
    "duration": 6.8
  },
  {
    "text": "to not be offended by someone else's",
    "start": 2472.079,
    "duration": 5.04
  },
  {
    "text": "speech habits",
    "start": 2474.96,
    "duration": 5.2
  },
  {
    "text": "and then have to defend yourself or leap",
    "start": 2477.119,
    "duration": 4.641
  },
  {
    "text": "in and say, \"Oh, you're being wrong.",
    "start": 2480.16,
    "duration": 4.48
  },
  {
    "text": "You're being wrong. You're right.\" all",
    "start": 2481.76,
    "duration": 5.359
  },
  {
    "text": "of the ways in which we communicate that",
    "start": 2484.64,
    "duration": 5.52
  },
  {
    "text": "don't have to do with things being my",
    "start": 2487.119,
    "duration": 7.841
  },
  {
    "text": "style, my way, my view. To keep in mind",
    "start": 2490.16,
    "duration": 7.76
  },
  {
    "text": "what's happening in the conversation is",
    "start": 2494.96,
    "duration": 6.72
  },
  {
    "text": "to hear the other person.",
    "start": 2497.92,
    "duration": 7.84
  },
  {
    "text": "A large part part of why speech is",
    "start": 2501.68,
    "duration": 7.919
  },
  {
    "text": "really about hearing and not speaking at",
    "start": 2505.76,
    "duration": 6.4
  },
  {
    "text": "all.",
    "start": 2509.599,
    "duration": 6.161
  },
  {
    "text": "What do I hear? What do I see? What's",
    "start": 2512.16,
    "duration": 7.72
  },
  {
    "text": "being reflected to me?",
    "start": 2515.76,
    "duration": 4.12
  },
  {
    "text": "You know, one of the most difficult",
    "start": 2521.68,
    "duration": 3.919
  },
  {
    "text": "things about these these 7 a.m. things",
    "start": 2523.119,
    "duration": 6.0
  },
  {
    "text": "is I don't get to see you out there and",
    "start": 2525.599,
    "duration": 5.76
  },
  {
    "text": "I don't know how my words are landing",
    "start": 2529.119,
    "duration": 5.361
  },
  {
    "text": "and I don't know what I can't see any",
    "start": 2531.359,
    "duration": 6.96
  },
  {
    "text": "faces. I can't see are you hearing what",
    "start": 2534.48,
    "duration": 5.76
  },
  {
    "text": "I'm saying. Am I saying something",
    "start": 2538.319,
    "duration": 4.321
  },
  {
    "text": "correctly? Am I saying something that",
    "start": 2540.24,
    "duration": 5.64
  },
  {
    "text": "makes sense?",
    "start": 2542.64,
    "duration": 3.24
  },
  {
    "text": "Become someone who really watches how",
    "start": 2549.76,
    "duration": 6.88
  },
  {
    "text": "your words are landing.",
    "start": 2553.44,
    "duration": 8.24
  },
  {
    "text": "Become someone who listens to themselves",
    "start": 2556.64,
    "duration": 9.28
  },
  {
    "text": "and says, \"How is my voice sounding?",
    "start": 2561.68,
    "duration": 7.679
  },
  {
    "text": "Does my voice sound harsh? Does my voice",
    "start": 2565.92,
    "duration": 9.04
  },
  {
    "text": "sound soft? Does my voice sound",
    "start": 2569.359,
    "duration": 9.281
  },
  {
    "text": "like it's full of revenge?",
    "start": 2574.96,
    "duration": 8.399
  },
  {
    "text": "Does it sound like it wants revenge?",
    "start": 2578.64,
    "duration": 9.76
  },
  {
    "text": "Is what I'm saying designed to seduce?",
    "start": 2583.359,
    "duration": 8.161
  },
  {
    "text": "Not because seduction is bad, but",
    "start": 2588.4,
    "duration": 5.439
  },
  {
    "text": "because I need to be really clear about",
    "start": 2591.52,
    "duration": 5.799
  },
  {
    "text": "my own intentions.",
    "start": 2593.839,
    "duration": 3.48
  },
  {
    "text": "Am I trying to persuade you of",
    "start": 2597.76,
    "duration": 7.88
  },
  {
    "text": "something? Or am I trying to fool you?",
    "start": 2599.839,
    "duration": 5.801
  },
  {
    "text": "Am I trying to lure you? Or am I trying",
    "start": 2607.44,
    "duration": 7.36
  },
  {
    "text": "to entice you?",
    "start": 2611.04,
    "duration": 7.64
  },
  {
    "text": "What are my intentions?",
    "start": 2614.8,
    "duration": 3.88
  },
  {
    "text": "And then how does that feel in my heart?",
    "start": 2619.04,
    "duration": 5.0
  },
  {
    "text": "Does that feel",
    "start": 2624.24,
    "duration": 6.359
  },
  {
    "text": "graceful and light?",
    "start": 2626.48,
    "duration": 4.119
  },
  {
    "text": "Do I feel safe with that?",
    "start": 2630.72,
    "duration": 6.96
  },
  {
    "text": "Can I trust my own voice?",
    "start": 2634.48,
    "duration": 7.24
  },
  {
    "text": "Can I trust my words?",
    "start": 2637.68,
    "duration": 4.04
  },
  {
    "text": "If I can trust my words, you can trust",
    "start": 2643.599,
    "duration": 6.681
  },
  {
    "text": "my words.",
    "start": 2647.04,
    "duration": 3.24
  },
  {
    "text": "If I can trust my words,",
    "start": 2651.68,
    "duration": 7.159
  },
  {
    "text": "you can trust my words.",
    "start": 2654.64,
    "duration": 4.199
  },
  {
    "text": "Why speech? Speech that does not harm",
    "start": 2661.04,
    "duration": 9.16
  },
  {
    "text": "includes speech to myself.",
    "start": 2665.92,
    "duration": 4.28
  },
  {
    "text": "Self-criticism",
    "start": 2671.2,
    "duration": 6.119
  },
  {
    "text": "can be very harmful.",
    "start": 2673.599,
    "duration": 3.72
  },
  {
    "text": "You're so stupid. How could you have",
    "start": 2677.359,
    "duration": 4.161
  },
  {
    "text": "done that?",
    "start": 2678.88,
    "duration": 6.32
  },
  {
    "text": "Ah, again with the critic. Let the",
    "start": 2681.52,
    "duration": 7.079
  },
  {
    "text": "critic go.",
    "start": 2685.2,
    "duration": 3.399
  },
  {
    "text": "Is it true?",
    "start": 2694.16,
    "duration": 3.48
  },
  {
    "text": "Is it useful?",
    "start": 2698.319,
    "duration": 4.641
  },
  {
    "text": "Is it timely?",
    "start": 2700.48,
    "duration": 4.639
  },
  {
    "text": "Is it kind?",
    "start": 2702.96,
    "duration": 3.84
  },
  {
    "text": "Practice",
    "start": 2705.119,
    "duration": 6.161
  },
  {
    "text": "because this is it. This is all we have.",
    "start": 2706.8,
    "duration": 7.36
  },
  {
    "text": "But this is really wonderful.",
    "start": 2711.28,
    "duration": 5.68
  },
  {
    "text": "This being alive,",
    "start": 2714.16,
    "duration": 5.36
  },
  {
    "text": "this being alive",
    "start": 2716.96,
    "duration": 6.119
  },
  {
    "text": "in this moment.",
    "start": 2719.52,
    "duration": 3.559
  },
  {
    "text": "May you know joy in this moment.",
    "start": 2723.28,
    "duration": 5.68
  },
  {
    "text": "And may it arise out of your own",
    "start": 2727.04,
    "duration": 5.68
  },
  {
    "text": "practice of all of the precepts",
    "start": 2728.96,
    "duration": 6.96
  },
  {
    "text": "and know that you can trust.",
    "start": 2732.72,
    "duration": 6.44
  },
  {
    "text": "Thank you.",
    "start": 2735.92,
    "duration": 3.24
  },
  {
    "text": "Have a wonderful rest of your day.",
    "start": 2744.96,
    "duration": 4.52
  }
]